WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.490
Someone once said:

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.620
There are crabs whose shells are 
sweet, fluffy, soft dorayaki...

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.590
Bean-jam Pancrabs!

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:59.800
And sweet varieties who live, sleeping 
soundly in chocolate coronets...

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.170
Chocolate Sleeper Crabs!

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:06.940
On a peninsula made from fried 
rice, the Fried Ricesula,

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:10.510
there is a beach from which spreads 
a sea of succulent Schezuan shrimp...

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.750
The Chili Chili Shrimbeach!

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.550
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.590
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Regal Highlands

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Devils' Playground

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
White Forest

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Black Carpet

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Mushroom Wood

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Ancient Marsh

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.920
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:25.860
Toriko's group was blown apart by 
a Rock Drum on the Black Carpet.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:30.290
Komatsu and Sunny, who were 
blown into the Mushroom Forest,

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.460
headed toward the habitat of the 
Regal Mammoth, the Regal Highlands,

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.270
by passing through the Ancient Marsh,

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:39.170
where they witnessed the terrible 
deeds of the Gourmet Corp.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:45.210
Toriko and Rin intimidated the beasts 
of the White Forest, tamed an Obasaurus,

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:48.780
and have arrived at the greatest test of all,

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:52.620
the Devils' Playground, on their 
way to the Regal Highlands.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.190
Terry is chasing after Toriko, 
with Tina and Kuruppo on his back,

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:00.390
in order to bring him the news that a GT 
Robot controlled by Starjun has broken in.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:06.100
3 GT Robots are already 
at the Regal Highlands.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:10.740
The scramble for the Regal Mammoth 
is heating up by the minute!

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Regal Highlands

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Devils' Playground

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
White Forest

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Black Carpet

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Mushroom Wood

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
Ancient Marsh

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.700
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:17.740
The Devils' Game! Clear 
the Devils' Playground!

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:36.160
T-The Devils' Playground... I've 
heard rumors, but it's super creepy.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.630
It's named the Devils' Playground.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:42.570
You choose one of the many routes, and 
if you make it to the top, you win.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.940
But each route has 10 stages,

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:49.470
and if you don't beat the boss who 
controls each stage, you can't move on.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.980
But you'll be fine, Toriko!

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:54.280
'Cause you're super strong!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.950
Nope. Not only have I taken a lot of damage,

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:59.780
I haven't eaten anything for a 
while, so my stamina is gone.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:03.690
I left all the food back where we 
were blown away by that Rock Drum.

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.460
Thanks, but I plan on avoiding 
the difficult stages!

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.860
Soldier Frog (Amphibious 
Beast) Capture Level 13

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.200
We'll blow through all at once!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.830
Rin, hold on tight!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.770
Sure...

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.900
Sorry 'bout this, but move outta the way!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.810
Depending on the route, 
there are low-level stages.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.280
We've got no choice but to choose those!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.750
Regal Island - Wastelands

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.450
Look at that, Sunny-san!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.190
That's a Candy Tree! {prepare for horrible pun}

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:41.730
Candy Tree (Natural Food) Capture Level 8

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.190
Oh! The tree that grows candy.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.420
The candy that grows changes 
depending on the season,

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.730
and they say it produces more 
than 100 million varieties!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:45.630
So that's why they also call them Oak Trees! {... I dunno. Have any bright ideas on this one?}{I racked my brain, but I got nothin'; figure just put a quick note in to explain the pun; I don't like it, but better than leaving viewers hanging, scratching their heads}

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:46.960
Note: 100 million = "oku", sounds like "oak"

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.200
O-Oh, right.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:53.440
Sunny-san, excuse me... 
Please hold this plate.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:57.480
Lay down some Shark Fin Mushrooms 
we got in the Mushroom Forest...

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.380
Shark Fin Mushroom (Mushroom) Capture Level 7

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:02.950
Take two varieties of 
almost snack-like candy...

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:07.120
Then, use the Gourmet Spicer 
I got from Toriko-san!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.420
Take off the arm part...

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.260
Put in the Candy we picked... {I'm avoiding "fruit" or "seeds" because it's hard to tell which is correct from the video}

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:16.230
Put the arm part back on, 
hold the lever tight,

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.000
crush up the two different kinds of snacks...

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.570
When you sprinkle it on 
the Shark Fin Mushrooms...

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:24.670
Finished!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.740
Sunny-san, please try eating it!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.380
The firm, yet supple mushrooms

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.720
are combined with the twin 
tastes of that original spice!

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.920
The two flavors are in perfect harmony!

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:41.290
This is too much!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.020
Plus, the mushroom is very nutritious!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.260
This is an excellent ingredient, yes!

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.630
The Gourmet Spicer is amazing!

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:53.500
Then with this, I'll make you a bunch 
of delicious dishes, Toriko-san!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.270
Toriko-san...

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.780
Axeox (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 22

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.320
Running out of strength...

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.490
Super Relaxation!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.060
Toriko!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.800
You saved my bacon, Rin!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.870
Huh? Sure...

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.210
Stage 2, clear! Let's keep moving!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:41.580
If Toriko was his usual self, he could 
have easily dodged that attack...

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.650
Toriko's super weak!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.750
Regal Island - Plains

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.990
Matsu, you needn't worry.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.790
Toriko's a tough one, he'll be fine.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.960
We're both heading for the Regal Highlands, 
so I'm sure we'll meet him there.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.030
Yeah...

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.470
Honestly.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:06.970
Don't you think you should be worrying 
about yourself instead of others?

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.840
Owww...

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.140
Oh? What's the matter?

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:14.710
Sunny-san, where are we right now?

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:17.080
T-That's...

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:21.150
Regal Highlands

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.220
What's with this place?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.960
It is definitely a land where Devils 
dwell... The Regal Highlands.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.660
Everywhere I go, the place 
is filled with corpses...

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.100
H-Hey, Gido!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.970
Oh, it's you, Zyper.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.300
What the hell are you doing?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.510
I-I was crushed by a Regal Mammoth...

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:44.910
Hurry and pick me up! {check}{good}

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.250
My core is still alive. I'm 
regenerating right now.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.410
There's a Regal Mammoth near here?

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.420
Yeah.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.790
I don't know you! Begone!

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.690
I'll be the one to hang this 
Mammoth head on my wall!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.560
Gido, you bastard!

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.290
I'll remember this next 
time we meet in person!

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:07.170
White Forest

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:09.700
What incredible speed!

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.900
He's going 100 km/h like it's nothing! {check}{good}

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.940
Plus, he's been going 
non-stop, with no breaks.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.840
What an incredible distance he's running!

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.910
Kuruppo, hang in there!

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:23.920
For him to be this desperate...

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.950
He's trying to warn Toriko about that 
thing's arrival as fast as possible...

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:29.090
Is that guy really that dangerous?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.030
Regal Island - Devils' Playground

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:44.940
Toriko!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.240
Stay back!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.480
Mystery Bird Rubanda (Avian 
Beast) Capture Level 30

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.820
Devils' Playground...

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:01.390
This is only stage 3! And you throw 
a Mystery Bird Rubanda at me?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.790
Was this the wrong route?

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.360
Toriko, behind you!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.900
It circled behind me in an instant?!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:11.830
No, that's not it.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.300
It doesn't have power or speed, but 
it has a unique way of moving...

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.610
Plus it's got damn hallucinogenic breath!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.470
Hallucinogenic breath?

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.240
Which one's the real one? If I was 
at full strength, I could tell...

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.450
But I'm at a loss!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:30.110
Obasurus, you're...

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.090
Go, Obasaurus!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.830
Hey! It didn't even make a 
millimeter's difference! {edit}{ok, just took out "fight" since we know the situation already}

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.840
Its breath is making me light-headed!

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:51.700
Toriko?

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.170
Rin, can you neutralize this stuff?

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.570
W-Wait a second.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:56.940
There it is.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.080
Thunder Peppermint Fragrance!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.410
It's a fragrance made by 
concentrating the menthol

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.150
extracted from the strong smelling 
Thunder Peppermint leaves.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.390
It has a such a powerful stimulant 
effect that with one whiff,

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.490
you won't go to sleep for five days.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:15.560
It might be a problem if it 
gets in your eyes, though.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.500
Don't worry, I'll close my eyes.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.330
As long as I can use my nose, I'll be fine!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.070
Rin!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.300
Thunder Peppermint!

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.010
Thunder Peppermint...

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.210
Just like the name says,

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:31.140
it's a mint so strong it's like 
being struck by a thunderbolt!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.810
My mind's as clear as day!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.210
I've got to search for its real body.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:37.720
Where are you?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.650
I'll chase you by your scent!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.950
You have to be here somewhere!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.460
Where are you?

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.630
I can smell you... You're close.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:51.360
Even with my eyes closed, I can 
smell you right in front of me!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.430
There!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.430
Knife!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.740
Pinpoint Concentration: Thunder Peppermint!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.140
Now!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.280
Eat this!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.140
What?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.480
I-Isolation!?

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.980
A technique where you move a 
part of your body at high speed.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.750
By skillfully adjusting the 
speed, you leave an afterimage.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.520
Your enemy can't determine your location.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.990
When you combine this thing's 
Isolation with its breath,

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.030
it's almost like it's cloned itself!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.900
Plus, it's really pissed 
off after Rin's attack!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.250
Toriko!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.740
Terry!

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:17.620
Terry!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.020
You're safe, Terry!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.960
I'm so glad you came for me!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.130
Man, I'm so jealous of you, Terry.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.940
Thank you, Kuruppo.

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.070
And we've got the extra baggage as well.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.840
How did you fall from the sky?

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.580
Finally, I'm freed from that speed.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.980
I don't have a single gram 
left of grip strength...

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.520
And wait, that's some crazy speed.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.790
You came all the way here 
from the Black Carpet?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.890
We passed through the White Forest.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.860
I was on Terry's back.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.520
The White Forest?

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.530
You may have gotten here

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.590
'cause Toriko and I chased off 
the beasts along the way, {check}{i.e. "We cleared the way for you"}

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.030
but even so, that was fast!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:07.500
That's because he ran 
non-stop without a break.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:10.740
Plus, I got the feeling that Terry 
kept getting faster and faster.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.810
Terry is growing rapidly.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.310
That's right, Toriko! We've got trouble!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.440
The GT Robot we met in the 
Puffer Whale cavern...

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.350
Man, you're persistent!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:23.920
Huh?

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.580
It's wary of Terry.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:30.020
That's 'cause Terry sensed 
its real body in an instant!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:33.120
Yeah. The Rubanda might have more power,

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.330
but it must get wary

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:38.060
after sensing a glimpse of the 
ultimate Battle Wolf in Terry.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.800
Terry!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.870
That's a different route!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.640
Terry!

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.610
Let's go.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.280
We'll follow Terry.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:57.780
But...

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.020
Terry's senses are as 
sharp as Sunny's sensors.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.020
That must be because his physical response

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.660
depends so much on his wild instincts. {edit}{changed}

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.760
It's tied to his ability to avoid danger.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.860
Something really dangerous 
is closing in, I bet.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.870
Let's trust in Terry!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:19.240
Sure! If that's what you say, 
Toriko, I'll believe you!

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:23.110
Hold it!

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.640
Terry...

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.450
Thank you!

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.280
You're running again?

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.680
I don't have any grip left!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.690
That route wasn't the correct way to go!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.460
Yeah! I'd much rather not have 
to face that thing, thank you!

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.030
Wait, Terry...

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.230
This isn't just an easy route 
through the Devils' Playground...

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:50.900
You're picking out a shortcut where we 
won't encounter any beasts, aren't you?

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:01.050
All right! We made it through 
the Devils' Playground!

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:03.280
It's all thanks to Terry! You did great!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.890
No more... I've got zero 
grams of grip strength...

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.060
Okay!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:18.260
We're finally at the entrance to the Regal 
Highlands where Regal Mammoths live!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.130
You think my brother made it here, too?

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.710
What's wrong, Terry?

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:33.510
Terry?

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.150
Could it be...

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:40.850
He's going back?

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.590
I bet it's because <i>it's</i> here.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:43.660
It?

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:47.360
The black GT Robot that we met 
at the Puffer Whale cavern.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.060
What?!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:01.870
Terry came to warn you of the 
danger from it invading here!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.540
Toriko, let's go save Terry!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.680
No. We'll head onward.

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:10.150
Terry was followed by that thing 
and wasn't able to shake it. {check}{just added the "following" bit}

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:15.390
So basically, Terry led it right to us. {check}{tweaked}

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:19.190
He was trying to lower the danger for me,

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:21.960
but he just invited even more danger.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:26.260
Terry noticed its presence, 
and decided to go defeat it.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:30.570
I can't let Terry's feelings 
and conviction be in vain.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:31.440
Let's go!

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.600
Toriko...

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.840
What's that voice I've been hearing...?

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.210
Sounds like a wolf to me.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.510
It's quite close.

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:44.180
Do you think it might be Terry?

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:47.090
Terry? Oh, that Battle Wolf.

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:49.150
That's not your normal sounding howl.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:51.960
D-Do you think something happened 
to Toriko-san and the others?

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:54.060
Yes... Something's happened, I'd reckon.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.930
He says it like it's no big deal!

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:56.890
And hold it...

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:57.700
"I reckon"?!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.660
Sunny-san, shouldn't we go rescue them?

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.840
Don't be silly. Everyone that came 
here is prepared for the consequences.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.000
You're the same way, yes?

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.110
Well...

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:10.680
I felt an unusual conviction 
in the howl we just heard.

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:14.150
To go to their aid now would 
dishonor that conviction!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.210
Sunny-san...

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.250
And besides, saving them with this timing...

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.280
...wouldn't be beautiful?

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.990
Yes! Isn't it more beautiful to 
save them at the last minute?

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.020
I-I wonder about that...

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.130
Let's hurry, Matsu!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.260
That GT Robot with the giant footprint

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.860
has likely already reached 
the Regal Highlands.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.130
I don't really know...

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:36.500
Understanding your sense of beauty 
is complicated, Sunny-san.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.840
But when we were blown away by the Rock Drum,

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.770
you casually saved me with your feelers,

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.580
and you were angered by the terrible 
deeds of the Gourmet Corp.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:47.480
You seem cold on the outside,

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.010
but you have a kind and passionate 
side to you as well. {I think cold is better than the literal cool here, right?}{agreed; of course, cool would work, but viewers might confuse it for Fonzie cool}

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:50.920
Matsu!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:51.850
Yes?

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.790
Now, we need to climb this first.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.660
This is an entrance to the Regal Highlands.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.930
The Regal Wall.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.630
A sheer cliff over 3000 meters tall.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.500
3000 meters?!

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:13.340
Sunny-san... I can't see the top at all!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.710
How are we supposed to climb this?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.610
Don't tell me we're going to rock climb...

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.380
We'll walk up it normally.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.380
Hold it!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:25.480
To me, this cliff is no 
different than flat ground.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:29.290
If I go at a moderately fast 
pace, I can make 5 km/h...

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.790
That means I'll be able to 
climb to the top in 36 minutes.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.060
I can't wait.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:38.230
The "food treasure" of ancient 
times, the Regal Mammoth!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:00.020
You damn monster!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:10.700
Hey, you've got to be kidding me! Look 
at its size! I can't even scratch it!

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:14.030
I bet the Vice Chief is already inside of it.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.570
I've got to go, too.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.190
I see...

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.330
So it's this guy's fault

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:43.130
that the Regal Highlands are 
filled with piles of bones...

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:46.600
On this island, there's only one 
creature at the top of the food chain.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.630
This guy is it!

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:53.740
Hey!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:59.380
It's moving farther and farther 
from the Regal Highlands!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.550
Is it searching for something?

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:05.380
Hey, watch out! If you go too far 
that way, you'll fall off the cliff!

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:10.590
I can't, I just can't!

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:12.360
Sunny-san, I can't!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.490
Quiet!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:21.400
Heavy Cliff (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 30

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.970
The inhabitants of the 
Regal Wall: Heavy Cliffs.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.200
They won't attack if we don't do anything.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:30.710
On the other hand, make them mad 
and they are quite the challenge.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.210
Whatever you do, don't incite them.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:39.150
What's this?

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.320
The sky is getting dark.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.060
Maybe it's storm clouds?

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:53.300
Hate to break it to you, but that 
doesn't look like a storm cloud.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:13.320
What the heck is that?!

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:36.040
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:42.280
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:49.590
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:54.460
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:59.630
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:03.000
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:07.440
on a journey with no end!

00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:12.410
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.580
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:21.550
amid the waves of time.

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:26.460
Gourmet News!

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:29.160
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:45.710
Candy Tree (Natural Food) Capture Level 8

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:33.330
The Candy Tree grows fruit 
that's almost like candy.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.800
The fruits are packaged and 
sold as snacks and chocolates.

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:42.410
According to the IGO, 
for five years in a row,

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:45.440
the things little kids 
want most is a Candy Tree!

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:48.210
And the most popular fruit 
of the Candy Tree is

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:51.250
Soft milk caramel and vanilla beans-style... {check this thing... Is it all one thing? Or is it a list of a bunch of things? It doesn't make much sense}{right, it doesn't, but it's supposed to be blah-blah-blah style and then next line, so yeah, all one thing}

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:55.120
ultra-special-premium garlic 
flavored Toriko snacks...

00:22:55.120 --> 00:23:00.860
It's a light snack with a mixed berry 
cheesecake chocolate topping, I hear.

00:23:00.860 --> 00:23:02.260
Pardon me!

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:04.460
And now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.690
I've got a treat for all you fans of handsome guys!

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:10.500
The Gourmet Hunter we've been waiting for arrives!

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.600
Flashes of kindness shining through his cool exterior makes girls swoon!

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:16.910
The Ultimate Backup! 
Clash, Coco vs. GT Robot!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.360
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
